---
import * as icons from "@grave/animated-icons/astro";
import { communicationIcons } from "../../../../helpers/communication-icons";
const sizes = [14, 16, 24, 28];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Communication recipe comparisons</title></head>
  <body>
    <h1>Communication recipe comparisons</h1>
    <p>The reference executes all ten original Lucide Animated React components from revision 4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26. Their class utility import points to a local equivalent. Mailbox also sets its intended 18px 11px origin through initial and uses view-box, because Motion otherwise replaces its style origin with the path center. React is confined to comparison pages.</p>
    <p>Hover a row or use its Replay button to animate both versions. Play all starts every sample. Stop all returns them to rest. Seek pauses the current playback at the selected time.</p>
    <p>PhoneIncoming, PhoneMissed, and PhoneOff use the requested size instead of their upstream fixed 24 px. The runner normalizes reference dimensions after mounting. PhoneIncoming and PhoneMissed return their handsets to scale 1 even though upstream omits the normal handset variant. Send keeps the complete plane visible and the decorative trail hidden at rest.</p>
    <p>PhoneCall uses cancellable native tracks for the fade and delayed spring reveal. Its two React phases are measured separately. Captured-pose return measurements reset reference velocity before stopping; real interrupted returns are checked for continuity through the adapter API.</p>
    <button type="button" id="play">Play all</button>
    <button type="button" id="stop">Stop all</button>
    <label>Playback time in milliseconds <input id="time" type="number" value="200" min="0" max="5000" step="50" /></label>
    <button type="button" id="seek">Seek and pause</button>
    {communicationIcons.map(icon => {
      const Component = icons[icon.name];
      return <section>
        <h2>{icon.name}</h2>
        <p><a href={`https://github.com/pqoqubbw/icons/blob/4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26/icons/${icon.slug}.tsx`}>Pinned upstream recipe</a> · <a href={`/${icon.slug}/`}>Manual controls and lifecycle</a></p>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Astro adapter</th><th>Upstream React component</th><th>Playback</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>{sizes.map(size => <tr data-icon={icon.slug} data-size={size}>
            <th scope="row">{size} px</th>
            <td data-adapter><Component size={size} controlled /></td>
            <td><div data-reference data-name={icon.name} data-size={size}></div></td>
            <td><button type="button" data-replay aria-label={`Replay ${icon.name} at ${size} pixels`}>Replay</button></td>
          </tr>)}</tbody>
        </table>
      </section>;
    })}
  </body>
</html>

<script>
  import "../communication-reference";
</script>
